        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adi nakunkeŋakeŋa kudi abulilaŋa kuŋahula. Adi nakunwanakudi abulilaŋa kunkepakeŋa. Nelili muza wabulili kutenenawu ijina dami nami, Ntalenu, ntalenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nololi makasami mwaana wejimakudi antu adikaŋa, endaŋa munjila yabula kuwaha mwaya yitoŋojokayawu awenawu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "antu anvulokaŋa kumesu ami hefuku hefuku, aketulaŋayimuna kumatempa, ochaŋa insensi hamatafwali; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ashakamaŋa kumajamu, akamaŋa kumbepu kumbeŋu; antu adyaloŋa mbiji yaŋulu, muzoŋu yayishimashima wudi mumanuŋu awu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ahoshaŋa nawu, Imanaku oku kwakanka weyi, bayi winza kwakwihi nanamuku, muloŋa ami nakubadikeyi kujila. Antu awa hiwishi mumazulu ami, hikesi kabutukaŋa mwaana wejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Tiyenu, anachisoneki dehi kumesu ami, nawu, Hinakamwenaku, nakayifwetesha, eŋa, nakayilubwila muntulu jawu kuluwaluwa kwenwenu aweni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nikuluwaluwa kwawankakulula jenu hamu, akwakwocha insensi hamapidi amaneni, antukilaŋa hamapidi anyanya. Dichi nakasambila kweseka mudimu wawu nakuwushikŋa muntulu jawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Chamwekanaŋa vinyu yayiha mumukanji, muntu hakwila nindi, Bayi muwukisapanaku, muloŋa wudi nankisu; dichi chinakayilila ambuŋami jakuyitoŋa, kulonda nakabuli kuyijilumuna wejima wawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "KuYakoba nakanyamunaku anyana, kuYuda nakanyamunaku answanajampidi jami, antu ami nátonda akayiswana, ambuŋa ami akashakamaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MuSharoni mwakekala muwudiilu wawayimuna, kuchinekineki chaAkori kwakekala kwakukambamaŋa aŋombi, nanochu chanankeŋakeŋuwu antu ami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila enu mwalekaŋa Yehova, mwavulamenaŋa mpidi yami yajila, mwaalilaŋa Mpemba mesa, mwemenaŋa Ihamba walwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nakayitoŋwela mpoku yakabali, wejima wenu mwakabanda mina kuyitaŋa; nanochu chinelili kutambika, enu kwitiya nehi; kuhosha, enu kutiya nehi; himukwila chuma chinantamini kumesu ami, himukutonda chuma chinabulaŋa akutiya kuwaha ami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Mwanta Nzambi nindi, Tiyenu, ambuŋami akadivaŋa, hakwilenu mwakatiyaloŋa nzala. Tiyenu, ambuŋa ami akanwaŋa, hakwila enu mwakatiyaloŋa mpwila. Tiyenu, ambuŋa ami akatiya ŋakuwaha, hakwila enu mwakatiyaloŋa ansonyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu, ambuŋami akembaŋa tumina twachiseki mumuchima, hakwila enu mwakadilaŋa nayihuŋu mumuchima, mwakakaloka nakubaloka nyichima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ijina denu dimwakashiya dakekala dakushiŋa ananachu antu ami inatondeli, Mwanta Nzambi wakayijaha; ambuŋindi wakayitumba ijina dacheŋi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kulonda muntu wukudikiswila nkisu hanuhamaseki, akadikiswilaŋa mudi Nzambi yansaŋu yalala, niwukusanyikahanu heseki akasanyiki Nzambi vansaŋu yalala. Muloŋa yuma yakala yakusambila anayivulameni dehi, muloŋa anayisweki mumesu ami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa tiyenu, hinukuleŋa mawulu amaha, nimaseki amaha, yumayakusambila hiyakayanuka nawaku, hiyakenza nikumuchimaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa tiyenu kuwaha nakuzaŋalala haya nyaka nayuma yinukuleŋa, muloŋa tiyenu, hinukulepa Yerusalema wakutiya antu kuwaha, niantu indi akuzaŋajalanawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami nakatiya kuwaha naYerusalema, nakazaŋajala nawantu ami. Himwamba katiyakana cheŋi ikumbu dakudila, hela kukalukanyitetuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hikwakekala nawa cheŋi mukeki wamafuku, hela kashinakaji wákubula kuwanisha mafuku induku. Muloŋa kansi wakafwa washikadehi munyaka nkulakaji, mukwanshidi wakashika munyaka nkulakaji wakashiŋewa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akatuŋa matala, akashakamamu. Akadima matempa anyivinyu, akadya nyikabu yayu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakela atuŋa, mushakama acheŋuku; adima, ayidya kudi acheŋuku. Muloŋa mafuku awantu ami akekala neyimafuku amutondu, antu ami inátonda akaluŋa luŋe-e nanyidimu yamakasawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakakabakana chamukunkulwayuku, hiyakasemena múuduku, muloŋa aneli dehi anyana kawakoole keshawu dehi kudi Yehova, hamuna wanyanawu akasemawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akamona chakwila nikutambika kanda, ami netiya dehi; achidi kuhosha, ami natiya dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikaŋawidi nimwana kamukoku akadiila hamu, mutupa wakadya matahu neyi ŋombi, hakwilanoka, kudya kwiudi yolunkuŋu. Kumpidi yami yajila yejima hiyakelilaku chatama hela kukisaŋanaku. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
